gbd4(){return" (learned)"},
gbd_(){return"Applies to this device only. Many people ride both \u2014 you can switch any time, in the planner too. Every ride remembers the profile at its start."},
gbd5(){return"Learned from your rides"},
gbd2(){return"Learn from my rides"},
bd6(a){return"Reset "+a},
gbd3(){return"From the time and elevation of your rides (recordings and those taken over via GPX import): for each ride the climbs of at least 100 m in one go, classified by the ways in your stored areas, the median per way class from three climbs on. Never from other people\u2019s rides; nothing leaves the device."},
